i=p?'- "remember": lasting facts about the person or their world that would help next time: who people are to them, their teams, places, preferences, routines, goals, what they study or own (like "Supports Manchester United", "Oishi is their sister", "Goes to the gym at 6 am on weekdays"). Short, third person, one fact each. Never one-off events, tasks, money amounts, moods, or passwords, ID or card numbers. If a fact above is repeated or confirmed by this note, return it again in the same words. Usually empty.\n':""
